      "assistant_text": "According to [[concepts/credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process, immediately before that process starts**. More specifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the spawned child process\u0027s environment\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated\n- This prevents a compromised Hub process from leaking the credential by inspecting environment variables\n\nThe same scoping model applies to the Query agent as well \u2014 it also receives the credential injected into its own environment at spawn, not from the Hub\u0027s process environment.",
